{"run_id": "20260816T231526-hepkg-48570", "qid": "gen-concept-09b348b4", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "How many analyses measured Observed and background-only-fit expected event yields in signal regions?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 18 distinct analyses that measured \"Observed and background-only-fit expected event yields in signal regions.\"\n\nTo provide more context, these 18 analyses cover a variety of observables related to event yields in signal regions, including:\n\n- Observed and background-only-fit expected event yields in signal regions\n- Observed vs expected event yield in a signal region (discovery/exclusion fit)\n- Significance of deviation between observed and background-expected yields per signal region\n- Observed event count in the final signal region\n- Local significance of observed-vs-expected yield deviation in a signal region\n- Per-signal-region observed event yield, predicted SM background, background-only compatibility (p0, local Z significance), and model-independent 95% CL upper limit on the number of beyond-SM events\n- Total post-fit SM background yield in a signal region\n- Predicted background yield in the final signal region\n- Background-only hypothesis discovery p-value and significance Z in a signal region\n- Model-independent 95% CL upper limit on the signal event yield\n- Model-independent 95% CL upper limits on visible BSM cross section and signal event yield ($\\sigma_{\\text{vis}}$, $S_{\\mathrm{obs}}^{95}$, $S_{\\mathrm{exp}}^{95}$) per signal region\n- 95% CL observed/expected upper limit on the number of BSM signal events (S_obs^95, S_exp^95)\n- Model-independent event limit\n- Observed (expected) significance of Higgs boson signal per production mode in H→WW\n- One-sided p-value (p0) / significance (Z) of background-only hypothesis per signal region\n- Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection for WH, H→bb production\n- Data vs. background significance in validation regions\n- Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection for ZH, H→bb production\n- Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection for VH, H→bb production\n- Model-independent superbin event counts: N_obs, N_pred_bkg, sigma(N_pred_bkg), and S_UL^95% signal-strength upper limits\n- Discovery p-value p(s=0) and local significance (Z) for background-only hypothesis\n- Sigma x B in STXS regions\n- Distribution of post-fit z-scores per analysis bin for the background-only fit\n\nThese analyses collectively provide a comprehensive view of the event yields and their significance in various signal regions.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2307.01094", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2508.13900", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "crosstab", "args": {"predicate_a": "result_reports_quantity", "predicate_b": "result_defines_region"}, "rows": 8668, "error": null, "seconds": 0.092}, {"round": 2, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Observed and background-only-fit expected event yields in signal regions", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 47, "error": null, "seconds": 31.207}, {"round": 3, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:b-jet-fraction", "hepkg:observable:background_yield_signal_region", "hepkg:observable:discovery-pvalue", "hepkg:observable:discovery-pvalue-significance", "hepkg:observable:event_yield", "hepkg:observable:excluded-particle-mass-lower-limit", "hepkg:observable:local-significance-data-background", "hepkg:observable:local_significance", "hepkg:observable:mbb-