{"run_id": "20260816T231526-hepkg-48570", "qid": "gen-concept-143800f6", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "How many analyses estimate the background Other backgrounds (diboson, $tZ$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $t\\bar{t}W$, $tWZ$)?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 39 distinct analyses that estimate the background \"Other backgrounds (diboson, $tZ$, $t\\\\bar{t}H$, $t\\\\bar{t}W$, $tWZ$)\" or related backgrounds. \n\nThis includes a variety of specific backgrounds such as diboson, $tZ$, $t\\\\bar{t}H$, $t\\\\bar{t}W$, and $tWZ$. The total number of facts and assertions related to these backgrounds is 109 and 123, respectively.\n\nTo provide more detail, the specific backgrounds and their facets are as follows:\n\n- **Other backgrounds (diboson, $tZ$, $t\\\\bar{t}H$, $t\\\\bar{t}W$, $tWZ$)**: Facets include Diboson, HiggsTTH, TTV.\n- **Other subdominant SM backgrounds (e.g. tZ, tWZ, ttW, tth, ttWW, tttt, ttt, Wh, Zh, single top, diboson in 1l)**: Facets include Diboson, HiggsTTH, HiggsVH, SingleTop, TTV.\n- **ttX background (tttt, ttH, ttW, ttZ)**: Facets include HiggsTTH, TTV.\n- **Rare backgrounds ($tZ$, $tW$, $tWZ$, $t\\\\bar{t}WW$, $VVV$, $t\\\\bar{t}t\\\\bar{t}$, $t\\\\bar{t}t$)**: Facets include Diboson, Multiboson, SingleTop, TTV, TTbar.\n- **Other minor SM backgrounds (WZ, ZZ, VVV, tW, WW, SM Higgs)**: Facets include Diboson, Multiboson, SingleTop, StandardModel.\n- **$tWZ$ background**: Facets include TTV.\n- **Diboson background (WW, WZ, ZZ)**: Facets include Diboson.\n- **Combinatorial backgrounds**: Facets include Diphoton, ForwardElastic, ZJets.\n- **$tWZ$ and $tZ$ rare SM background (dilepton channel)**: Facets include TTV.\n- **ttbar, diboson, nonprompt-lepton and rare ttbar-associated production backgrounds in ttW measurement**: Facets include Diboson, FakeNonPrompt, TTV, TTbar.\n- **Diboson background (2$\\\\ell$OS channel, combined)**: Facets include Diboson, SingleTop.\n- **Other multiboson background ($ZZ$, $W^{\\\\pm}W^{\\\\pm}$, $VVV$)**: Facets include Diboson, Multiboson.\n- **ttγγ and other top-associated background (ttH, tH categories)**: Facets include Diphoton, HiggsTH, HiggsTTH.\n- **Top quark background (ttbar, single top, ttW, ttZ)**: Facets include SingleTop, TTV, TTbar.\n- **$t\\\\bar{t}V$/$tZ$ background**: Facets include TTV, TTbar.\n- **$VV$ (diboson) background**: Facets include Diboson.\n- **$t\\\\bar{t}V$/$tWZ$ background**: Facets include TTV, TTbar.\n- **Multiboson background (WWW, WWZ, WZZ, ZZZ)**: Facets include Multiboson.\n- **ZZ and WZ diboson background (multile", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Other backgrounds (diboson, tZ, ttH, ttW, tWZ)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 32.038}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_ttbar", "hepkg:background:bbtautau_ttbar", "hepkg:background:combinatorial-background", "hepkg:background:continuum-tth-th", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson-2lOS", "hepkg:background:diboson-rjr", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "hepkg:background:diboson