{"run_id": "20260816T231526-hepkg-48570", "qid": "gen-concept-1ae2ccc9", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "How many analyses measured Jet multiplicity (N_jets)?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records **10** distinct analyses that measured Jet multiplicity (N_jets) or related observables.\n\nThis count includes all papers that measured any of the following observables:\n\n- Jet multiplicity (N_jets)\n- N_jet (extra-jet multiplicity, jet pT > 40 GeV)\n- N_jet (extra-jet multiplicity, jet pT > 100 GeV)\n- Differential fiducial cross section as a function of number of associated jets N^jet\n- Differential WZ cross section vs jet multiplicity\n- [N_jet(0,1,2+), m(ttbar), |y(ttbar)|] triple-differential cross section (3 jet bins)\n- [N_jet(0,1+), m(ttbar), |y(ttbar)|] triple-differential cross section (2 jet bins)\n- [N_jet(0,1,2,3+), m(ttbar), |y(ttbar)|] triple-differential cross section (4 jet bins, first measurement)\n- [N_jet, |y(t)|] double-differential cross section\n- [N_jet, pT(t)] double-differential cross section\n- [N_jet, m(ttbar)] double-differential cross section\n- [N_jet, |y(ttbar)|] double-differential cross section\n- [N_jet, |Δη(t,tbar)|] double-differential cross section\n- Relative charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}} \\) vs \\( N_{\\mathrm{jets}} \\)\n- [N_jet, pT(ttbar)] double-differential cross section\n- Absolute differential \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) cross-section vs \\( N_{\\mathrm{jets}} \\)\n- Differential \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) cross section vs \\( N_{\\mathrm{jets}} \\) (4ℓ channel)\n- Normalised differential \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) cross-section vs \\( N_{\\mathrm{jets}} \\)\n- Differential \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) cross section vs \\( N_{\\mathrm{jets}} \\) (3ℓ channel)\n- Signal acceptance times efficiency (Aε) as a function of m_Z', by production category (ISR flavor/multiplicity) and jet-multiplicity signal region\n\nEach of these observables is considered relevant to the concept of Jet multiplicity (N_jets).\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2110.11231", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Jet multiplicity (N_jets)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 33, "error": null, "seconds": 17.355}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:HT_bjets", "hepkg:observable:HT_jets", "hepkg:observable:R_b_over_j", "hepkg:observable:R_c_over_b", "hepkg:observable:R_c_over_j", "hepkg:observable:acceptance_efficiency", "hepkg:observable:acrel-njets", "hepkg:observable:deltaR_bb_avg", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-jet-multiplicity", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-njets-3l", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-njets-4l", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-njets-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-njets-norm", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_njet", "hepkg:observable:dilepton-mass-spectrum", "hepkg:observable:light_jet_mistag_rate", "hepkg:observable:m_jj", "hepkg:observable:n_b", "hepkg:observable:n_jets", "hepkg:observable:njet0123_vs_m_ttbar_vs_yabs_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:njet012_vs_m_ttbar_vs_yabs_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:njet01_vs_m_ttbar_vs_yabs_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:njet_pt100", "hepkg:observable:njet_pt40", "hepkg:observable:njet_vs_deta_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:njet_vs_m_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:njet_vs_pt_top", "hepkg:observable:njet_vs_pt_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:njet_vs_yabs_top", "hepkg:observable:njet_vs_yabs_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:pt_b1_add", "hepkg:observable:sr-event-yield-limit", "hepkg:observable:superbin-yields"], "set_1_kept": ["hepkg:observable:R_b_over_j", "hepkg:observable:R_c_over_j", "hepkg:observable:accep