{"run_id": "20260816T231526-hepkg-48570", "qid": "gen-concept-3397b8d8", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Count the analyses that estimate the background Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background from Z+jets and ttbar.", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 35 distinct analyses that estimate the background \"Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background from Z+jets and ttbar\".\n\nThis count is based on the 68 facts and 72 assertions linked to the relevant background entities. \n\nTo provide more context, the specific background entities considered include:\n- Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background from Z+jets and ttbar\n- Z+jets (FNP-lepton) background\n- Nonprompt lepton background, multilepton channel\n- Nonprompt lepton and WZ boson production background in ttZ measurement\n- ttw competing backgrounds (ttbar, diboson, nonprompt-lepton, and rare ttbar-associated production)\n- FNP lepton background (ttbar, tW, WW, Z+jets) in RJR selection\n- ttbar background (1-lepton selection)\n- Nonprompt lepton background, SS dilepton channel\n- Nonprompt/jets-misidentified-as-leptons (\"Jets\") background\n- Non-prompt and fake-lepton background\n- Z+X background (VZ, ttZ; genuine p_T^miss with SF lepton pair from Z/gamma*)\n- ttbar (semileptonic/dileptonic) background\n- ttZ background (3-lepton selection)\n- TOP background (ttbar, single t, ttH, ttV), single-lepton channel\n- Top quark pair (ttbar) background\n- Top-quark (ttbar and single-top) background\n- Fake and heavy-flavor-decay lepton background\n- Top-quark pair and single-top (ttbar, Wt) background\n- ttZ and tZq irreducible background\n- Background from jets misidentified as tau_h candidates (QCD multijet, W+jets, ttbar, diboson)\n- Fake/non-prompt lepton background\n- Z+X non-prompt/misidentified lepton background (bbZZ)\n- QCD (multijet) background, single-lepton channel\n- Non-prompt (heavy-flavour) lepton background\n- Strong-interaction Z+jets background for the EW Zjj measurement\n\nThese entities were identified as relevant to the background estimation in the specified context.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background from Z+jets and ttbar", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 38.027}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_ttbar", "hepkg:background:bbtautau_ttbar", "hepkg:background:bbzz_zplusx", "hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:ew-singlelepton", "hepkg:background:fake-hf-leptons", "hepkg:background:fake-nonprompt-leptons", "hepkg:background:flavor_symmetric", "hepkg:background:fnp", "hepkg:background:fnp-lepton", "hepkg:background:fnp-lepton-rjr", "hepkg:background:fourtop_backgrounds", "hepkg:background:gjets_tth_had", "hepkg:background:jet-to-tauh-misid", "hepkg:background:jets-nonprompt", "hepkg:background:lost_tw_background", "hepkg:background:mis-id-leptons", "hepkg:background:misid-lepton", "hepkg:background:misid_lepton", "hepkg:background:mt_background", "hepkg:background:multiboson-3l", "hepkg:background:multijet-z", "hepkg:background:multijet_allhad_ttbar",